      {
        "url": "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/feature/marvel-super-heroes-release-notes",
        "facts": "Red Hulk and Spider-Man choose targets only for the separate post-action trigger. Red Hulk must survive to receive the counter. Grim Reaper independently chooses the returned attacker defender and finality applies to any permanent."
