  "printed_obligation_evidence": {
    "Red Hulk": {
      "body_reach_trample": "Paid4RR gives6/7, actual Reach blocks paid flying Hawk, natural attack/trample assigns lethal2 to Bear and excess5 to player.",
      "actual_damage": "SelfDamaged reuses completed damage observer before SBA, groups positive damage once per exact recipient, aggregates multiple dealers, ignores other victim, zero and actually prevented damage. Queued trigger survives later ability loss; suppression before event does not queue it.",
      "counter_success": "PutSourceCounterReflexive carries an owned optional completion through central CounterBatch. Only actual nonzero matching-kind placement on exact live source creates one child, after all replacement ordering/commit. Two Seasons double it to4 yet one child; placement may affect an exact noncreature permanent. Departed/blinked/lethal source and explicit zero action create none. Successful +1/-1 cancellation still creates child with live quantity0.",
      "later_target_and_quantity": "Union preserves players plus other damageable permanents; original exact source/land rejected, both players/PW/creature tested, opponent hexproof enforced. Child own source-counter facts initialize from selected child program, not parent walker. Damage amount reads live total at child resolution, then latest exact departure LKI after counter/control changes, never rebound incarnation.",
      "independent_packets": "Source control changes preserve original ability actor and counter placer; damage source current/latest-departure controller receives lifelink. Explicit copied parent packets each place once; copied child packets deal independently without placing. Source reentry may be another target; stale target reentry fizzles."
    },
    "Grim Reaper, Lethal Legionnaire": {
      "body_attack_and_payment": "Paid3B gives3/4; ordinary attack triggers untargeted optional3B, decline and shortage reject early target. Actual Swamp and Wastes production funds real resolution payment before child targets. Captured controller persists after source theft/departure/blink and before payment.",
      "later_target": "Independent reflexive child selects exact own graveyard creature card after success; foreign grave/noncreature/live/stale targets rejected; target departure/reentry fizzles without refund, copied exact child cannot return it twice.",
      "entry_transaction": "Exact target enters under captured controller, forced tapped, with finality in pre-entry counter transaction. Two Seasons yield4 finality counters with owned replacement-order pause. Diamond Mare owns pending as-entry color choice; old target remains in graveyard until commit. Returned sick creature attacks immediately without declared-attack trigger.",
      "defender": "Separate truthful public defender menu independent of Grim original player defender, choose opponent PW with exact reference; own player and stale PW incarnation rejected atomically. Defender departure during a bounded pending-entry probe yields no invalid attacker. Outside combat/with nonactive controller it enters tapped with counter, without attacking. Shared entry commit checks current creature/current combat/legal exact defender.",
      "finality": "Actual paid Murder exiles finality recipient instead of graveyard. Counter removal or bounce/reentry clears replacement; ability loss leaves finality replacement intact."
    }
  },
  "legality_privacy_owned": "All scenario mutations use existing checked raw/index/restore helpers. Owned payment, target, defender, entry-value and competing counter-replacement pauses drop parent, compare full both-seat snapshots/views, restore and reject stale indices. Illegal actions preserve snapshot/revision/state_bytes. Hidden opponent hand substitution leaves full actor observation and legal actions equal; targeted GY/defender info remains public, no private hand chooser masquerade.",
